# Claude Code. The instructions and settings of an SI session stay on each machine, not in the repo.
**/.claude/
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md

# Local API cache of calibration tables and file layouts
server/.cache/

# The demo video's raw material: captures, rendered frames, and single pictures are built, not kept.
